{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120760","id":3960975054,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7sF67O","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120760","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120760.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120760.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120760","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120760/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120760/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120760/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f9d80b1d8464cc8db35c7865da992f1c6d611dd","number":120760,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix various actions causing code autocompletion to desync","user":{"login":"AtomicAntt","id":89709922,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NzA5OTIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89709922?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt","html_url":"https://github.com/AtomicAntt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtomicAntt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107327\r\n\r\nUsing various shortcuts or other actions while code completion is active would cause code autocompletion to desync. Below are examples of breaking shortcuts/actions that could desync code completion, which this PR fixes:\r\n\r\n- `CTRL` + `Backspace` (Backspace word)\r\n- `CTRL` + `Z` (Undo)\r\n- `CTRL` + `X` / `Shift` + `Delete` (Cut)\r\n- `CTRL` + `V` (Paste)\r\n- `CTRL` + `Home` (Caret document start)\r\n- `CTRL` + `Enter` (New blank line)\r\n- `CTRL` + `Left` (Caret word left)\r\n- `CTRL` + `Right` (Caret word right)\r\n- `CTRL` + `Shift` + `K` (Delete line)\r\n- `CTRL` + `Shift` + `J` (Join lines)\r\n- `CTRL` + `Shift` + `Enter` (New line above)\r\n- `CTRL` + `/` & `CTRL` + `K` (Toggle comment)\r\n- `CTRL` + `Shift` + `E` (Evaluate selection)\r\n- `Alt` + `R` (Create code region)\r\n- `Alt` + `Up`/`Down` (Move Up/Down)\r\n- `Shift` + `Left`/`Right`\r\n- `CTRL` + `Shift` + `Left`/`Right`\r\n- `Shift` + `Home`\r\n- `Shift` + `End`\r\n- Edit menu buttons like `Cut`,  `Paste`, `Undo`\r\n- Connecting a signal to a method (`ScriptTextEditor::add_callback`)\r\n- Fold all lines shortcut\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTo solve the issue, caret line changes as well as any text changes are tracked, and if it finds any unaccounted changes that do not filter code completion, code completion is canceled.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, `cancel_code_completion` is no longer called for some methods that don't need it anymore, which will include these actions:\r\n- `Ctrl` + `.`/`,` (Go to next/previous breakpoint)\r\n- `Ctrl` + `G` (Go to line)\r\n- `Ctrl` + `B` (Go to next bookmark)\r\n- `Ctrl` + `Shift` + `B` (Go to previous bookmark)\r\n- `Home`\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFi